# kills: DR1 rule G by resize: open on Edit, rotate in either direction, and the band and padding follow
# suite: node --test --test-name-pattern ^DR1.rule.G.by.resize.* tests/drawer_grid.test.js
# Neither the pan column nor the sheet body is observed and the keyboard offset no longer calls syncBand, so a shrinking scrollport leaves the stuck state stale (rule G-e).
# Re-anchored 2026-10-19 (lane P).
# The sheet body is not observed, so a keyboard shrinking the scrollport leaves the stuck state stale (rule G-e). Widened 2026-10-19 (dual input, lane H2b'): the keyboard offset now also calls syncBand, so the missing observer alone is equivalent; the keyboard offset and the plate band's own observer keep the stuck state fresh in every scenario the suite can build, so the mutant drops the body observer, the plate-band observer and the keyboard-path call together.
